stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> pending : decision emits effects, inserted with the execution
    pending --> claimed : ClaimPending, SKIP LOCKED, 60 second claim lease
    claimed --> delivered : destination accepted the effect
    claimed --> pending : ScheduleRetry with exponential backoff
    claimed --> quarantined : attempts reached max_attempts
    pending --> pending : claim expired and another publisher reclaimed it
    delivered --> [*]
    quarantined --> [*]

    note right of claimed
        Claim, Deliver, Retry and Quarantine
        only accept specific source states.
        Backoff is 2^(attempts-1) seconds,
        capped at 60 seconds. effect_id is
        sha256 of tenant, event, rule set,
        revision, rule and action index, so
        the destination can deduplicate.
    end note
